  "fixes": [
    "CollectionEditView / MediaCollectionEditView / GlobalEditView / CollectionListView / MediaCollectionListView — header rows and action groups gain flex-wrap gap-y-2; edit headers h-16 → min-h-16. Root cause of pagesEdit@375 (+19px), pagesEdit@390 (+4px), themesList@375 (+16px): shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap button groups (Revalidate·Save·Cancel = 270px; Revalidate all·+ New Theme = 275px) never wrapped.",
    "DataTableBulkActions — max-w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2, so the bar Step 1 made reachable cannot overflow at 375.",
    "CreateDocumentModal — w-[50svw] h-[50svh] → w-full h-[80svh] sm:w-[50svw] sm:h-[50svh]. Was a 187px-wide dialog with 115px inputs at 375; now 343px / 263px.",
